  "question": {
    "text": "A rigid square loop of side <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8216;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> and carrying current <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is lying on a horizontal surface near a long current <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> carrying wire in the same plane as shown in figure. The net force on the loop due to the wire will be:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0182_8ce35f8b18c3.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 241px;\" />"
  },
