  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0182_fc79b01bdb87.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 197px;\" /><br />Force on segment 1-2 and 3-4 will get cancel out.<br />Force on segment 4-1,<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> toward Right<br />Force on segment 2-3:<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> toward left<br />Net force on loop:<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> toward Right<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> toward Right or repulsive"
